IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `nsw-dictionary`

-- Tests for nsw-dictionary.l4: every entry is found under each of its names, with the connective the text prints.
-- The connective expected for each entry was read from the printed first line of the entry (the "-- src:" line above it), not from the table.
-- A term the Dictionary does not define is not covered: "day", "week" and "year" have no entry.

#ASSERT `Schedule 4 the entry for the term` "affidavit" EQUALS JUST `Schedule 4 'affidavit'`
